-- Imported by batch-typically-collide-secimport.l4, with the module beside it.
-- Both declare `scaled` under `§ Pricing`, with a TYPICALLY default on `rate`.

§ `Pricing`

GIVEN rate IS A NUMBER TYPICALLY 3
      base IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
scaled MEANS rate TIMES base

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
useOne MEANS scaled WITH base IS n
